# 16. PERFORMANCE AND ERROR STATES

Implement deliberate handling for:
- Initial loading.
- Page transitions.
- Data fetching.
- File upload.
- CSV validation.
- Analysis execution.
- Export.
- Authentication errors.
- Permission errors.
- Empty results.
- Invalid data.
- Network failures.
- Storage failures.

